        "label": "2nd quarter",
        "score": "JAX 14, NE 3",
        "text": "Trevor Lawrence hit Josh Cameron for a 12-yard touchdown (7–0 with 13:29 left), and Andy Borregales' 35-yard field goal made it 7–3. Lawrence's 10-yard touchdown pass to Jakobi Meyers made it 14–3 with 4:23 left. Marcus Jones intercepted a Lawrence pass that bounced off Brenton Strange's hands, but Travis Hunter picked off Drake Maye on third-and-goal in the end zone with 1:02 left, his first career interception."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd quarter",
        "score": "JAX 28, NE 3",
        "text": "Lawrence's 17-yard touchdown pass to Parker Washington, a fingertip catch in the end zone, capped a 15-play, 72-yard drive for a 21–3 lead with 1:08 left. Jarrian Jones intercepted Maye on the next play, and Chris Rodriguez Jr.'s 5-yard run made it 28–3 with 50 seconds left in the quarter."
      },
      {
        "label": "4th quarter",
        "score": "Final: JAX 35, NE 6",
        "text": "Borregales' 40-yard field goal made it 28–6, and Bhayshul Tuten's 1-yard run with 8:02 left finished the scoring. Maye was pulled in the fourth quarter."
      }
    ],
